title: Start
position: -336,-546
---
The  memories are a bit fucked up, everything it's fuzzy when you haven't drank in a while. 
When you're mouth gets so fucking dry that your body actively fight you swallowing, and it feels like having a swamp instead of a palate. 
Everyone was like that back then in the jovian system. The shutter really got us all desperate.

I remember it like it was yesterday.
Dad trying to get in contact with the Martian authorities to get us on a shuttle. He saying we're gonna be fine, that we have enough water to survive the cut off.
We're just gonna have to ration water correctly. 

-> Fuck that!
    ... I'm not gonna see my friends die. the system is almost out of water at this point. fuck earth,
    -> and fuck the Martians!
        their fucking treaties are not doing shit for us! 
        -> I'll find another way to help, we don't need them.
            <<jump RecruitReb>>
        -> Maybe dad's contact knows how I can help. 
            <<jump RecruitMar>>        
    -> hopefully the Martians will help us.
        <<jump RecruitMar>>
        
-> Hopefully he's right
    I really couldn't handle this on my own.
    <<jump RecruitMar>>
    //They will have martian passports
